    NOTE: Individual /blog/:id URLs are intentionally NOT hardcoded here.
    Hardcoding blog IDs risks listing deleted posts as valid URLs, and
    cannot stay in sync with database additions without a build step.

    The dynamic sitemap at https://infx.space/sitemap.xml (served by the
    Express backend at runtime) queries the blog_posts table and includes
    all actual existing post IDs with accurate lastmod dates.

    If you are submitting to Google Search Console, submit the dynamic
    sitemap URL rather than this static file.
